1f:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-If your university is not in the table",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"If your university is not in the table"}],[["$","p","For Bologna, Sapienza, Turin or another institution, open the exact degree call. A general admissions homepage, last year’s call or another department’s date cannot establish your deadline.",{"children":"For Bologna, Sapienza, Turin or another institution, open the exact degree call. A general admissions homepage, last year’s call or another department’s date cannot establish your deadline."}],["$","p","Before shortlisting a later round, record whether it accepts visa applicants living abroad. An EU/resident-only round is not a backup for every international applicant.",{"children":"Before shortlisting a later round, record whether it accepts visa applicants living abroad. An EU/resident-only round is not a backup for every international applicant."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L29",null,{"id":"guides/italy-university-application-deadlines:section-2","title":"Check your progress","items":["Exact degree and intake identified.","Applicant category accepts my residence/visa situation.","Closing date, time and payment task recorded.","Documents required at application distinguished from later enrolment evidence."]}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for If your university is not in the table","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/","children":["Bologna admission and funding",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/university-of-turin-admissions-scholarship